PLACEHOLDER - Export not included in repository

This file is a placeholder for the Presentation_Slides.pptx PowerPoint presentation.

To generate this file:
1. Export key diagrams from Visual Paradigm as high-resolution PNG images (300 DPI)
2. Create a new PowerPoint presentation (16:9 widescreen format)
3. Add title slide with project information
4. Insert one diagram per slide with descriptive titles
5. Add speaker notes and annotations
6. Apply consistent theme and branding
7. Save as "Presentation_Slides.pptx"

Recommended slide structure:
1. Title Slide - Smart Plug AI Architecture
2. System Overview Use Case Diagram
3. Device Management Use Case Diagram
4. Secure Device Pairing Activity Diagram
5. Secure Command Execution Activity Diagram
6. Database ER Diagram
7. Secure Pairing Sequence Diagram
8. System Architecture Component Diagram
9. Phase 1 Gantt Chart
10. Security Features Summary
11. Questions & Discussion

Expected file size: 5-15MB
Recommended slide count: 10-15 slides

See 7_Exports/README.md for detailed generation instructions.
